Subject: CPMS I03E2 Seed Case and Mutation Operator Catalogue
Description: Canonical formation for reviewed root-qualified seed recipes, deterministic layer-typed mutation operators, unsigned case proposals, expectation review, and advisory coverage selection against I03E1 obligations. It creates no fixture, reader result, admitted expectation, compatibility claim, or implementation authority.

