& [Purpose] is propose reviewable witnesses without manufacturing truth
  + define root-specific starting shapes
  + define deterministic one-change transformations
  + propose mappings to exact obligations
  + leave expected outcomes and corpus admission to separate reviewed authority

& [AuthorityState] is formation_only
  + no seed value case bytes fixture generator reader execution review signature or active lock exists
  + zero requirements are implemented or verified

& [PrerequisiteIdentity] binds exact active future I03E1 obligation output
  + parent I03E claim and report profile
  + exact bundle root source reader ingress residual and resource identities carried by I03E1
  + future generator code version operator registry limits and post-I03D lock
  + formation may define records before any prerequisite is active but cannot materialize proposals

& [SeedLifecycle] is ordered
  + SeedArchetype is a source-reviewed recipe without concrete value
  + ConcreteSeedProposal is one exact byte payload or typed fixture identity plus construction proof and unsigned proposed expectations
  + ReviewedSeed joins an exact proposal to an ExpectationReview
  + AdmittedSeed requires a later satisfaction signature and catalogue lock
  + no lifecycle stage overwrites its predecessor

& [SeedCompleteness] is explicit
  + minimum_structural reaches one syntactic target with the least declared shape and may remain semantically incomplete
  + complete_safe meets every named prerequisite for one safe_pure semantic binding
  + actual_response is one constructible ProcedureToolResponse under exactly one response-root intended use
  + metamorphic_control is an already reviewed seed used only to test a named stage invariant

& [CarrierTypes] are closed
  + exact_bytes
  + admitted_json
  + typed_fixture
  + declared_relation with an exact underlying construction carrier
  + an operator refuses a carrier mismatch rather than converting implicitly

& [MutationOperator] is a deterministic partial function
  + version carrier allowed coherence modes preconditions parameter schema target locator primary dimension declared change schema applicability projection resource formula and source
  + every invocation either produces one complete proposal with proof or one bounded refusal
  + no operator observes schema or typed acceptance while generating

& [CoherenceModes] are closed
  + isolated_break changes one governing value while deliberately retaining named dependent evidence stale
  + coherent_successor changes one governing value and recomputes every named dependent through exact safe pure construction
  + metamorphic_control changes representation while proposing a named invariant
  + changed fields bytes and recomputed dependents remain explicit in all modes

& [OneMutationRule] governs lineage
  + one primary semantic dimension per MutationApplication
  + canonical escaping length prefixes or digests changed as declared consequences do not become hidden primary mutations
  + more than one primary dimension requires a finite MutationChain with one case identity per edge
  + chain depth limit is fixed before activation

& [ByteOperatorRegistry] is closed for profile 0.1
  + BYTE_INVALID_UTF8
  + BYTE_TRUNCATE
  + BYTE_APPEND_TRAILING
  + BYTE_DUPLICATE_MEMBER
  + BYTE_ESCAPE_EQUIVALENT_DUPLICATE
  + BYTE_WHITESPACE
  + BYTE_REORDER_OBJECT_MEMBERS
  + TOKEN_NUMBER_BOUNDARY
  + each operator binds exact input and output spans and performs no general parse-reserialize round trip

& [TokenNumberBoundary] preserves numeric evidence
  + target is one I03B-retained numeric token span
  + replacement text is exact bounded JSON number grammar
  + relation is below at above or representation-exhausting against one named bound
  + output bytes preserve every non-target byte
  + faithful ingress reruns later and no f64 or generic Value conversion is an oracle

& [DuplicateIdentityOperators] remain byte-level
  + literal duplicate copies one existing decoded member identity
  + escape-equivalent duplicate introduces a second spelling decoding to the same Unicode scalar sequence
  + offsets object path raw names decoded identity and insertion proof are retained
  + no admitted_json operator can create duplicates

& [MetamorphicByteControls] are span-preserving
  + legal whitespace changes only whitespace spans
  + object reorder moves complete key-colon-value-comma member slices without changing token bytes
  + controls predict only named ingress schema or typed invariants and remain unsigned until review

& [JsonOperatorRegistry] is closed for profile 0.1
  + JSON_OMIT_PROPERTY
  + JSON_INSERT_UNKNOWN_PROPERTY
  + JSON_REPLACE_KIND
  + JSON_SET_NULL
  + JSON_ENUM_OUTSIDE
  + JSON_CONST_CHANGE
  + JSON_STRING_BOUNDARY
  + JSON_ARRAY_DUPLICATE
  + JSON_COLLECTION_BOUNDARY
  + each begins from admitted instance JSON and emits exactly one duplicate-free complete value
  + no JSON operator mutates a canonical schema

& [CanonicalSchemaImmutability] is absolute
  + five I02 documents retain exact bytes
  + external missing malformed dynamic and escaping reference mutations belong to bounded I03A or I03D validator-profile probes
  + I03E2 may cite an InheritedProfileProbe digest against a profile obligation
  + inherited probes never become public-root cases or corpus bytes

& [TypedOperatorRegistry] is closed for profile 0.1
  + TYPED_OPTION_STATE
  + TYPED_ENUM_VARIANT
  + TYPED_SET_CONTENT
  + TYPED_RESPONSE_STATUS
  + TYPED_FIELD_REPLACE
  + TYPED_SERIALIZATION_REPLAY
  + construction uses safe reviewed builders and ordinary type invariants
  - never: unsafe memory private-field bypass invalid discriminant post-serialization edit or arbitrary deserialization as typed construction

& [ResponseConstructibility] is root qualified
  + base_response and preparation_response have separate archetypes and intended uses
  + status schema outcome verification prepared request faults and residuals combinations are named by the recipe
  + typed evidence exists only for bytes actually emitted by a constructible value
  + a mutated impossible response byte sequence can be schema-only evidence but not typed-common evidence

& [RelationOperatorRegistry] is closed for profile 0.1
  + REL_DIGEST_ALTER
  + REL_IDENTITY_SUBSTITUTE
  + REL_PREDECESSOR_REMOVE
  + REL_GENERATION_STEP
  + REL_LOGICAL_TIME_STEP
  + REL_PARTICIPANT_SET
  + REL_RESPONSE_SHAPE
  + REL_ZERO_CAPABILITY_ASSERTION
  + every relation operator names exact carrier coherence mode governing path dependents and relation broken or preserved

& [RelationSafety] prevents execution leakage
  + digest recomputation uses only exact safe pure function bindings
  + zero-capability cases observe fields counters and declarations without invoking provider model service network or effect behavior
  + identity substitution never impersonates a principal outside the fixture graph
  + prohibited authority remains expected refusal or non-execution proposal

& [ApplicabilityProposal] is unsigned
  + operator may project which stages appear structurally eligible
  + byte ingress failure proposal marks later stages likely skipped_dependency
  + typed output operator applies only to the selected response root
  + relation operator may be semantic_only
  + actual applicability expectation and CommonSyntaxClaim require exact-output review

& [ExpectationReview] is separate
  + binds exact case content identity payload digest proposed obligations claims stage expectations and rationale
  + reviewer can accept refine split or reject each element
  + corrections create a successor review or new case when content changes
  + review itself grants no corpus admission until later signed catalogue lock

& [FamilyArchetypePlan] is complete
  + C00 minimum structural and complete safe input roots plus actual base and preparation response roots
  + C01 byte framing duplicate token and resource guards
  + C02 required unknown null kind enum and const object rules
  + C03 exact numeric token and typed destination boundaries
  + C04 collection recursion and inherited local-reference profile proof
  + C05 identity digest authorship and lineage relations
  + C06 state generation logical time token participant transcript and replay relations
  + C07 no-capability refusal response-shape and inherited external-reference profile proof

& [ProposalEnumeration] is deterministic
  + lexical archetype operator and canonical parameter order
  + exact precondition evaluation and checked forecast before output materialization
  + no random clock environment thread hash-map file-enumeration or model input
  + identical input catalogues yield byte-identical proposal records and ordering

& [AdvisorySetCover] reduces review load without claiming optimality
  + start from all mandatory uncovered obligations
  + score mandatory newly covered descending then total newly covered descending then mutation edges fixture bytes construction cost ascending then candidate id lexical ascending
  + select first score repeat until no candidate covers a remaining obligation
  + leave remaining obligations as explicit gaps
  + reviewer rejection causes deterministic recomputation with a retained rejection edge

& [CaseIdentity] is independent of verdict
  + binds profile root seed predecessor operator version parameters carrier coherence output digest provenance and proposed mapping digest
  + ExpectationReview owns its own digest
  + admitting or rejecting a review cannot rewrite case content identity

& [ProposalCatalogue] is structurally valid even when case payload is invalid
  + invalid UTF-8 or malformed JSON exists as bounded opaque case bytes and digest
  + catalogue record remains well-formed canonical data
  + exact payload size offset and diagnostic limits prevent embedding unbounded failures

& [Atomicity] is fail closed
  + operator refusal records no case
  + overflow exhaustion invariant violation nondeterminism or source mismatch prevents a complete proposal catalogue
  + no partially generated catalogue is described as admitted reviewed covered or passed

& [Limits] are fixed before implementation
  + exact maxima for archetypes operators parameters proposals mutation chain depth fixture bytes changed ranges fields dependents obligation edges rationale and selection steps
  + parent 4096 admitted cases and 67108864 aggregate fixture bytes remain upper bounds rather than generation targets
  + every splice count product offset and allocation uses checked arithmetic

& [FutureSourceTouch] remains unsigned
  + exact implementation module under I03E source plan
  + focused generator and deterministic-selection test
  + compile-time archetype operator and proposal catalogue inventory
  + every path bytes digest and role enters activation lock
  + no runtime file read write cache database or service

& [Proof] after future activation includes
  + every operator success refusal precondition and boundary
  + token and member-span byte preservation
  + one-mutation changed-field account and successor chains
  + two response-root constructibility and impossible-byte exclusion
  + deterministic enumeration set-cover trace rejection recomputation and exact replay
  + invalid payload within valid catalogue and atomic exhaustion

& [FormationBoundary] is strict
  + source SJS canonical exploded requirements justification plan review inactive lock proof narrative and evidence metadata only
  - never: concrete seed case fixture generator Rust parser validator reader semantic execution agreement compatibility admission provider model service persistence network effect production hardware FPGA or shared inference

& [Disposition] is canonical_formation_complete_generation_refused
